# Decision Notes

Use this directory for durable decisions that future agents or maintainers should understand.

Write a note when a decision changes architecture, local infrastructure, deployment behavior, generated tooling, data ownership, or long-lived developer workflow.

Keep notes short. Capture the context, the decision, why rejected alternatives were not chosen, and what would make the decision worth revisiting.

Do not write notes for routine implementation details, temporary debugging, or changes already obvious from a small commit diff.
